item.description:
&lt;blockquote&gt;too much info to respond to...&lt;/blockquote&gt;

No doubt, but you should see all the stuff I leave out! One problem is that I see everything, and I mean everything (including Nothing) connected. Yet, I&#039;m dealing within a paradigm that endlessly makes distinctions, until all we&#039;re left with is a haystack of unconnected needles. The irony is this: in writing I can&#039;t help but make distinctions too; writing demands it. To paraphrase chapter 56, &lt;a href=&quot;https://centertao.local/tao-te-ching/carl/chapter-56/&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;Knowing doesn’t write; writing doesn’t know&lt;/a&gt;. It is just crazy!

Yes Craig, friends for life, and stepping into the winter of my life helps me appreciate that all the more... sigh
